<!-- Dark (decision 0056): the desktop's dark values, role for role. Warm
     near-blacks, never pure black; the green lifted so it still reads as
     Qurb's on them; glass a slightly lighter dark with a faint light edge.
     Roles not named here keep their light value, and are ones that work on
     both: the glow, and white on green. -->
